solution:
To solve the problem, we compute the area of regular pentagon $ABCDE$ in two different ways.  First, we can divide regular pentagon $ABCDE$ into five congruent triangles.

[asy]

unitsize(2 cm);

pair A, B, C, D, E, O, P, Q, R;

A = dir(90);

B = dir(90 - 360/5);

C = dir(90 - 2*360/5);

